cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PhotoLean, please cite both the software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "PhotoLean: a machine-checked genealogy of photochemical theory"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of seventeen phenomenological photochemistry / photophysics theories over a
  shared kernel, with a machine-checked relation module that registers equivalences, one-way
  entailments, composition edges, definitional certificates, look-alikes whose differences are
  theorems, a complete registry of pairs without an edge (136/136 pairs accounted for), and three
  adjudications of literature conflations with iff boundaries and witnesses.
